                    <num>1A</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>Subsection (1) does not apply to the following:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-1__qstr-1__sec-4B__subsec-1A__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>a decision that the death of a veteran was not war-caused;</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-1__qstr-1__sec-4B__subsec-1A__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>a decision that an injury suffered by a veteran is not a war-caused injury;</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-1__qstr-1__sec-4B__subsec-1A__para-c">
                      <num>c</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>a decision that a disease contracted by a veteran is not a war-caused disease;</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-1__qstr-1__sec-4B__subsec-1A__para-d">
                      <num>d</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>a decision that the death of a member of the Forces (within the meaning of <ref href="#part-IV">Part IV</ref>), or a member of a Peacekeeping Force (within the meaning of that Part), was not defence-caused;</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-1__qstr-1__sec-4B__subsec-1A__para-e">
                      <num>e</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>a decision that an injury suffered by a member of the Forces (within the meaning of <ref href="#part-IV">Part IV</ref>), or a member of a Peacekeeping Force (within the meaning of that Part), is not a defence-caused injury;</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-1__qstr-1__sec-4B__subsec-1A__para-f">
                      <num>f</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>a decision that a disease contracted by a member of the Forces (within the meaning of <ref href="#part-IV">Part IV</ref>), or a member of a Peacekeeping Force (within the meaning of that Part), is not a defence-caused disease.</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
